      ],
      "notes": [
        "Adafruit 5795 / TL040HDS20-B1502A. Separate flex-mounted non-touch display installed by hand in J601.",
        "RGB565 drives the upper five red and blue bits and all six green bits. DB0 and DB12 are grounded.",
        "10k holds RESET low during host startup. 10k holds CS high. Place 33-ohm R605 at the host PCLK source.",
        "Y17B boots in RGB mode. Leave CS high after panel reset. No serial initialization table.",
        "Use J601 pin 1 and the actual flex contact face to verify placement before applying backlight power."
      ]
    },
