      "notes": [
        "VSYS from BQ24074 powers boost. The two independent 4-LED strings each receive 19.97 mA with 63.4k at ISET.",
        "EN follows filtered VIN. Native BL_PWM at 20 kHz sets brightness. Hold low through reset and panel initialization.",
        "L601 4.7 uH. D601 band/cathode goes to LEDA. C603 2.2 uF / 50 V. C604 330 nF.",
        "R602 10 ohms and C602 1 uF filter driver VIN. Keep the switching loop short and clear of microphone lines."
